{"id":"89cc8db92b5fad14","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-gl-to-lob.md","title":"GL Arithmetical Soundness Corollary","display":"cor-gl-to-lob — GL Arithmetical Soundness Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-gl-to-lob","aliases":["89-cor-gl-to-lob"],"display":"cor-gl-to-lob — GL Arithmetical Soundness Corollary","depends_on":["[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-gl-to-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-gl-to-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gl-to-lob — GL Arithmetical Soundness Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the set of arithmetical realizations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}to\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\,\n\\bigl(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}to\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\,\n\\bigl(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi^*\">\\(\\varphi^*\\)</span> : 算术解释</li>\n<li>GL定理在每个 PA 算术实现下都可证；这是\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab8391d7623da45d\" href=\"?note=ab8391d7623da45d\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical\">89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical</a> 的直接重述。</li>\n<li>原文件名为链接兼容而保留，但该陈述是一般算术可靠性，并非只关于\nLöb 定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-